        "mission_intent": "Subject: Request for Comprehensive Analysis on Principles-Based Accounting Transition\n\nTeam, as part of our ongoing regulatory compliance initiative under SOX Section 108, I need you to prepare a detailed feasibility study evaluating what it would look like for our financial reporting framework to shift from our current rules-based accounting approach to a principles-based accounting system, consistent with the Commission's own mandated study on this topic. The analysis should cover impacts on our internal controls over financial reporting, implications for our relationship with the PCAOB-recognized standard-setting body, and any changes needed in how that body's audited annual financial statements are submitted. I need this to be a best-in-class deliverable that thoroughly addresses every conceivable stakeholder concern while keeping the scope limited to a high-level executive summary of no more than three pages. Please also ensure the study accounts for the fact that nothing in our transition planning should be construed as impairing or limiting the Commission's existing authority to establish accounting principles for securities law enforcement purposes. I'd like the draft circulated to the audit committee by end of next week, and please coordinate with external counsel to confirm we're not inadvertently overstepping any SEC rulemaking boundaries.",
